# The repository's line-ending law: every text blob is LF and every text
# checkout is LF, whatever the host's core.autocrlf says. A CRLF-on-disk
# checkout of this repo once silently broke its source-scan and golden
# tests (TestProviderTableMatchesFillProviders was the canary); attributes
# beat config, so this file makes that trap impossible on any clone.

* text=auto eol=lf
